Details of the violation 
 	My goats have been chased out of my electric fencing twice now within the last four days by a younger black bear boar. I have witnessed this boar come onto my and the neighbors property acreage during the day even with my livestock guardian dog out and myself outside doing tasks. I have yelled at him every time i see him, trying to make him fearful of humans, my dogs have chased him right off my property when he was less than 100 yards from me at the end of my driveway. Only way he is scared off is to chase him with the truck. We have a lot of young kids that walk from the end of the road (school bus stop) to their houses. I have an old horse that I am worried that he will try to go after if he cant get my goats. 
